{"id":"n61190-30-7","stage":0,"title":"보다 · 见面","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61190-30-7-1","ko":"남자 친구랑은 주로 언제 만나서 놀아?","zh":"你一般什么时候和男朋友见面玩？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남자","meaning":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","explanation":"남자：男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}},{"text":"친구랑은","meaning":"和男朋友（作为话题）","explanation":"친구（朋友）＋랑（和）＋은（提示话题）；与前面的 남자 合起来表示“和男朋友”。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구랑은","audio":"/audio/1f46408623d3cfd9d58d.mp3"}},{"text":"주로","meaning":"通常、主要","explanation":"주로：以某种情况为主；这里问通常何时见面。","readings":[{"term":"주로","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91767","senseId":"1","lemma":"주로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주로","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：疑问词“什么时候”；结合本句询问时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"만나서","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나서","audio":"/audio/642da571c6fc80e0d142.mp3"}},{"text":"놀아?","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"so