"저녁이나","meaning":"晚上或者","explanation":"저녁（傍晚、晚上）＋이나（或者）；与后面的 토요일 构成两个时间选项。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁이나","audio":"/audio/84d38ea96490dd01374f.mp3"}},{"text":"토요일에","meaning":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","explanation":"토요일：星期六，周六，礼拜六；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"토요일","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30214","senseId":"1","lemma":"토요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"토요일에","audio":"/audio/0a45a76483d1b3b0e744.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"666599febd987f53","term":"보통","zh":"通常、一般","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3","entryId":"65572","definition":"通常、一般","pronunciation":["보ː통"]},{"id":"a594e9b583050ec4","term":"금요일","zh":"星期五，周五，礼拜五","audio":"/audio/a594e9b583050ec46ff9.mp3","entryId":"17289","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第五天。","pronunciation":["그묘일"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚、晚上","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"傍晚、晚上","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"9f4eef79554b65d0","term":"토요일","zh":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3","entryId":"30214","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第六天。","pronunciation":["토요일"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a2094c19724e9fc800f9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.72,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61190